# Rust build output
/target/
/tomlctl/target/
/statusline/target/

# tomlctl advisory-lock sidecars (O45 — ephemeral coordination files;
# automatic cleanup not yet implemented in tomlctl).
*.toml.lock
*.lock
!Cargo.lock
# bun.lock is the SPA's lockfile; build.rs runs `bun install --frozen-lockfile`
# in a fresh worktree, so it MUST be tracked (else the frozen install fails).
!lumina/web/bun.lock

# Local SQLite dev databases (disposable; schema lives in migrations/)
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db.*

# Plan-merge rollback siblings (one generation, deleted by /plan-update complete)
*.premerge.md

# Backlog evidence: this repo is public and has no LFS, so everything under the
# evidence tree stays untracked at every depth — including a file dropped at the root
# rather than into an item directory. The two negations re-admit exactly the item
# directories and their `.evidence` markers, which is what keeps each drop-box visible
# cross-clone; the directory re-include must precede the marker one, because git cannot
# re-include a child of a directory that is still excluded.
/.claude/backlog-evidence/**
!/.claude/backlog-evidence/*/
!/.claude/backlog-evidence/*/.evidence
